    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d420">

                <pb facs="0550" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.51/919</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bundy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-23"><hi rendition="#italic">January 23,
                            1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received March
                        12.</hi>]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 291</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor in confirmation of the
                    Legation’s cable of Jan. 22, 1 [<hi rendition="#italic">7</hi>], p.m.,
                        1919,<anchor n="8" xml:id="d420-f1"/> to transmit herewith a certified copy
                    of <pb facs="0551" n="466" xml:id="pg466"/> the law authorizing and empowering
                    the President of Liberia to accept the proffered loan credit of $5,000,000.00
                    from the Government of the United States, etc. The text of this law as passed by
                    the Legislature and approved by the President is exactly the same as the text
                    received by the Legation in Department’s cable of Jan. 16, 5, p.m.<anchor n="8"
                        xml:id="d420-f2"/></p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard C. Bundy</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d420-a1.xml" xpointer="d420-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
